---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { socials } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Rohit Kumar | Founder & Builder" description="Meet Rohit Kumar, founder of Leadomi. I build software and digital products, using AI and modern tools to solve business problems.">
  <section class="about-hero page-shell"><div class="about-hero-copy"><p class="section-kicker" data-reveal><span>03</span> About / My story</p><h1 data-reveal>I'm a founder.<br /><em>Always building.</em></h1><p data-reveal>At 22, I'm a business owner and hands-on builder, always learning and turning real business problems into useful products.</p><div class="about-links" data-reveal>{socials.map((social) => <a href={social.href} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{social.label} <Icon name="external" /></a>)}</div></div><div class="about-portrait" data-reveal><img src="/images/rohit.webp" alt="Rohit Kumar" fetchpriority="high" /><div class="about-portrait-note">LEARNING FAST<br />BUILDING DAILY <span>↗</span></div><span class="about-portrait-number">RK—22</span></div></section>
  <section class="about-story page-shell"><div class="story-label" data-reveal><p class="section-kicker"><span>01</span> How I build</p><span>LEARN BY BUILDING</span></div><div class="story-body" data-reveal><h2>I stay close to the work.</h2><p>I've spent three years developing software and freelancing. I work across product decisions, customer needs and the details that make a solution useful. I'm always learning, then putting those lessons into something real.</p><p>I founded <a href="https://leadomi.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Leadomi</a> and created <a href="https://otpwala.me" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">OTP Wala</a>. I stay close to the business problem, the product and the technology behind it.</p><p>I use AI and modern development tools for research, prototyping and custom automation when they help move a business forward.</p><div class="about-quickfacts" aria-label="My experience at a glance"><div><strong>22</strong><span>Founder</span></div><div><strong>03</strong><span>Years building</span></div><div><strong>02</strong><span>Products built</span></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="principles-section page-shell"><div data-reveal><p class="section-kicker"><span>02</span> How I work</p><h2>Stay curious.<br /><em>Keep shipping.</em></h2></div><div class="principle-grid"><article data-reveal><span>01 / Listen</span><h3>I find what’s stuck.</h3><p>I start with your business problem, not a tool looking for a reason to be used.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>02 / Learn</span><h3>I pick tools that help.</h3><p>I keep learning about new ideas and AI, then use what fits the job.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>03 / Build</span><h3>I get it ready to launch.</h3><p>I bring product thinking, software and connected systems together in a solution built to ship.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="education-row page-shell" data-reveal><div><p class="section-kicker"><span>03</span> Learning</p><h2>Curiosity is part<br /><em>of the toolkit.</em></h2></div><div class="education-items"><article><span>COMPLETED</span><strong>Bachelor of Computer Applications</strong><small>BCA graduate</small></article><article><span>IN PROGRESS</span><strong>Master of Computer Applications</strong><small>MCA candidate</small></article><article><span>IN PRACTICE</span><strong>Web development & freelancing</strong><small>3 years of experience</small></article></div></section>
  <section class="closing-cta page-shell" data-reveal><p class="section-kicker"><span>04</span> Work together</p><h2>Tell me what’s<br /><em>not working.</em></h2><div class="closing-bottom"><p>I’ll bring fresh thinking, modern tools and a builder’s mindset.</p><a href="/contact/" class="closing-arrow" aria-label="Contact Rohit Kumar"><Icon name="arrow" /></a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
